		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>リバティガーデン島へ
行かれますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-11T05:37:30" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
