				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→msg_c03p13_captain_03
　いいえ→msg_c03p13_captain_04
・このセリフは初回のみ
　２回目以降は、msg_c03p13_captain_05
※swanで処理変更</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-24T07:19:45" />
